---
import ExternalIcon from "./ExternalIcon.astro";
import Quote from "./Quote.astro";
---

<section id="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-heading" class="pt-16 sm:pt-24">
  <h1 id="intro-heading" class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl" data-reveal>
    Hello! <span aria-hidden="true">👋</span>
  </h1>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <p data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 1">
      Nice to meet you! My name is Josh, and I'm currently a software engineer at
      <a href="https://www.ada.cx" class="link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Ada<ExternalIcon /></a
      >.
    </p>
    <p data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 2">
      When I'm not working or studying, you can find me working out
      <span aria-hidden="true">🏋️</span>, watching basketball <span aria-hidden="true">🏀</span> (go
      Raptors!), gaming with friends <span aria-hidden="true">🎮</span>, working on personal projects
      <span aria-hidden="true">🛠️</span>, or (most likely) eating food
      <span aria-hidden="true">🍜</span>.
    </p>
    <p data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 3">
      Thank you for visiting my website, and I hope you have a nice day!
    </p>
    <p data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 4">
      All the best,<br />
      Joshua Yu
    </p>
    <p class="text-base text-muted" data-reveal style="--reveal-index: 5">
      P.S. If you were wondering, my middle/Chinese name is Junxiao/<span lang="zh">浚潇</span>, hence
      the <em>j</em> in joshua<em>j</em>yu.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Quote cite="William Shakespeare, As You Like It">
    “The fool doth think he is wise, but the wise man knows himself to be a fool.”
  </Quote>
</section>
